Bind Npc 24427 Zone 1
Quest 411 "[Repeatable Solo] Death Knight Hunt"
    Repeat always
    Journal "[Guard] Melverick has commissioned you to hunt Death Knight. However, it will not count when you are in a party."
    Kill 20 of 1154, 1104 at direction_105

Requires player level >= 40 and player is karus

Rewards
    Give 1000000 experience or 1400000 with premium

direction_105 = location "Death Knight" about "Death Knight\nAn undead like the undying, possesses great strength as it is composed of powerful bone structure" found "Karus" karus at 1185 1220 in zone 1

On available
    Say "Master, Melverick is looking for you. I wonder when these missions would end..."
    Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close

On offer
    Show quest "This is the your mission. You've been an enormous help. The prey is Death Knights, skeletons known for their power."

On in_progress
    Say "Please do your best till the end!"
    Topic "Where can I find it?" do
        Map direction_105

On claimable
    Show quest "Thank you. I will remember your name!"
